      "updated": 1772947788688,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这是【原始的 X】；同时，\n这也是用于计算损失的【标签 Y】。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这是【原始的 X】；同时，\n这也是用于计算损失的【标签 Y】。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "I-E64oIln9Dh7xJhx286m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 639.0859561608246,
